{"id":"dsseldorf","name":"杜塞尔多夫","en":"Düsseldorf","country":"Germany","lat":51.2256,"lng":6.7767,"dek":"莱茵河畔的商务与艺术之城","history":"杜塞尔多夫最早的文字记载出现在1135年。1186年，这里被纳入贝格领地。1288年8月14日，杜塞尔多夫获得城市地位，此后逐渐成为贝格领地的行政与政治中心。1380年，它成为贝格领地区域首府，这一地位为其后来的城市发展奠定了制度基础。\n\n在约翰·威廉二世统治时期（1690年至1716年），杜塞尔多夫经历了显著的成长。约翰·威廉二世的妻子安娜·玛丽亚·路易萨·德·美第奇热衷艺术，促成了一座大型艺术画廊的建立，收藏绘画与雕塑。约翰·威廉二世去世后，城市一度衰落，尤其到了卡尔·泰奥多尔时期，他继承巴伐利亚并迁居慕尼黑，带走大量艺术收藏。拿破仑战争期间，杜塞尔多夫遭到破坏，曾被拿破仑视为贝格大公国首府。1815年拿破仑战败后，整个莱茵兰与贝格成为普鲁士王国的一部分，莱茵省议会设立于杜塞尔多夫。\n\n19世纪中叶，工业革命带来复兴，人口大幅上升。1920年，杜塞尔多夫成为罢工中心，同年4月15日，45名德国矿工联盟代表遭到自由军团谋杀。二战中，杜塞尔多夫几乎被盟军日夜轰炸夷为平地。1945年4月18日，当地市民发动莱茵兰行动，协助美国第97步兵师无血开城。1946年，杜塞尔多夫成为北莱茵-威斯特法伦州首府，战后重建由此展开。","culture":"杜塞尔多夫的老城区在二战后依据历史平面图在原墙基上重建，外观近似一座完整的历史老城。这个约一平方公里的区域内聚集了约260家酒吧、咖啡馆和酿酒坊，夜晚和周末被称作“世界上最长的吧台”。这里也是Altbier的产地，一种上层发酵的深色啤酒，在历史酿酒坊里以传统方式供应。\n\n杜塞尔多夫艺术学院是这座城市文化影响力的重要来源，校友包括约瑟夫·博伊斯、保罗·克利和奈良美智。学院及其周边的电子与实验音乐氛围影响广泛。城市里保留了许多仍在维护的煤气路灯，傍晚时分给老城和若干历史街区带来特殊的光线。","pull":"老城的酒吧连成世界上最长的吧台。","sights":[{"name":"老城区","orig":"Altstadt","intro":"二战中几乎全毁，后按历史平面图在原墙基上重建，白天是购物街，夜晚转为酒吧集中区。方圆一平方公里内约有260家酒吧、咖啡馆和酿酒坊，供应本地Altbier。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/D%C3%BCsseldorf_%28DE%29%2C_Jan-Wellem-Reiterdenkmal_--_2014_--_2313.jpg/960px-D%C3%BCsseldorf_%28DE%29%2C_Jan-Wellem-Reiterdenkmal_--_2014_--_2313.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":600},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%9C%E5%A1%9E%E5%B0%94%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%AB%E8%80%81%E5%9F%8E"},{"name":"国王大道","orig":"Königsallee","intro":"沿科格拉本运河两岸展开的著名林荫大道，两侧为高端精品店、珠宝店和画廊。零售与办公租金属于德国最高水平，是城市的商业门面。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/GER_D%C3%BCsseldorf%2C_K%C3%B6nigsallee%2C_Stadtgraben_0003.jpg/960px-GER_D%C3%BCsseldorf%2C_K%C3%B6nigsallee%2C_Stadtgraben_0003.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C3%B6nigsallee_(D%C3%BCsseldorf)"},{"name":"莱茵塔","orig":"Rheinturm","intro":"莱茵河畔的杜塞尔多夫最高建筑，塔身设有分段显示的灯光计时。塔上有餐厅，可俯瞰河岸与城市天际线。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Rheinturm_-_Gesamtansicht_vom_Medienhafen.jpg/960px-Rheinturm_-_Gesamtansicht_vom_Medienhafen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1974},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8E%B1%E8%8C%B5%E5%A1%94"},{"name":"本拉特宫","orig":"Schloss Benrath","intro":"城南的巴洛克风格宫殿，后方为法式花园，四周被森林环绕。靠近莱茵河，宫殿周边是杜塞尔多夫高档别墅区。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Schloss_Benrath_S%C3%BCdseite_seitlich.jpg/960px-Schloss_Benrath_S%C3%BCdseite_seitlich.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":629},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E6%8B%89%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%AE"},{"name":"媒体港","orig":"Medienhafen","intro":"20世纪50年代为河运码头，后期荒废。世纪末起由美、德建筑师参与改造，现为德国现代建筑最集中的区域之一，保留码头性格，建筑形态多样。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/D%C3%BCsseldorf-_Medienhafen_-_55257701316.jpg/960px-D%C3%BCsseldorf-_Medienhafen_-_55257701316.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":540},"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"杜塞尔多夫芥末烤肉","orig":"Düsseldorfer Senfrostbraten","intro":"以芥末酱烤制的猪肉，莱茵地区风味菜。老城内许多德式餐馆供应，适合搭配Altbier。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/D%C3%BCsseldorfer_Senfrostbraten_3.jpg/960px-D%C3%BCsseldorfer_Senfrostbraten_3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":721},"src":null},{"name":"莱茵酸味炖牛肉","orig":"Rheinischer Sauerbraten","intro":"醋腌牛肉配葡萄干与红甘蓝，入味偏酸。传统酿酒坊餐厅如Brauerei im Füchschen可尝到本地做法。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/S%C3%A4chsischer_Sauerbraten.jpg/960px-S%C3%A4chsischer_Sauerbraten.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":540},"src":null},{"name":"半只鸡","orig":"Halve Hahn","intro":"并非鸡肉，而是一块奶酪配芥末与酸黄瓜，放在黑麦面包上，是莱茵地区的经典酒吧小食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Halvenhahn.jpg/960px-Halvenhahn.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":772},"src":null},{"name":"旧啤酒","orig":"Altbier","intro":"杜塞尔多夫特有的上层发酵深色啤酒，以传统方式在历史酿酒坊供应，酒杯空了往往会自动续上。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/Diebels_in_Altbierglas.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":1412},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altbier"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/D%C3%BCsseldorf_Panorama.jpg/1280px-D%C3%BCsseldorf_Panorama.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":549},{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/Jan_van_der_Heyden_and_Adriaen_van_de_Velde_-_View_of_D%C3%BCsseldorf_with_the_church_of_St._Andrew_in_the_centre.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":1007}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[6.6888147,51.2294946],[6.6911584,51.2289047],[6.6931453,51.2265311],[6.6932823,51.2249721],[6.7078526,51.2246139],[6.7078714,51.2253137],[6.7126417,51.225632],[6.7178334,51.2240337],[6.7211929,51.2268516],[6.723549,51.225936],[6.7224183,51.2238357],[6.7225634,51.2214366],[6.7299704,51.209485],[6.7314893,51.2052082],[6.7306532,51.1896821],[6.7329418,51.1862155],[6.7372222,51.1833591],[6.7442538,51.1813368],[6.7522205,51.1809314],[6.7744355,51.1852969],[6.7800502,51.1856025],[6.7872401,51.1841578],[6.7933206,51.1808697],[6.7970422,51.1764424],[6.7983618,51.1702417],[6.7973571,51.1649049],[6.7932911,51.1566776],[6.7928526,51.1522313],[6.7946504,51.1479092],[6.7989588,51.1444762],[6.8055911,51.1428761],[6.8144692,51.143874],[6.8205606,51.1470671],[6.8295884,51.1566022],[6.8355306,51.1604933],[6.8413525,51.1624134],[6.8489276,51.1622432],[6.8556